```rust
/// Injects a list of macros before the decorated function.
///
/// The macros are applied in head-insertion order, meaning the first macro in the list
/// is the outermost macro.
///
/// # Usage
///
/// ```rust
/// use hyperlane_core::*;
/// use hyperlane_macros::*;
///
